{"title": "Propelling Strike", "pageid": 23219, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Propelling_Strike", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Repelling_Blast\" title=\"Repelling Blast\">Repelling Blast</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Repelling_Blast.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Repelling_Blast.webp/300px-Repelling_Blast.webp, /w/images/c/c1/Repelling_Blast.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Repelling_Blast.webp/300px-Repelling_Blast.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Repelling_Blast.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Propelling Strike</b> is a passive feature which pushes targets 4.5 m (15 ft) away on a hit.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>On a hit, push the target 4.5 m (15 ft) away from you. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Abby\" title=\"Abby\">Abby</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714204854\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.027 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.033 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 530/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1686/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 884/4194304 bytes\nHighe